  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zanzibar Education 2010-13 - ZanzibarEducation2008-13 - NEW STRATEGY</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Zanzibar Education 2010-13</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In alignement with the MOEVT ZEDP II, which is the national strategic plan for the education sector in Zanzibar, priority areas has been
&#x2022; Expanding Access to Education, with a Particular Focus on Primary Education
&#x2022; Capacity Building for Staff at the Ministry of Education and Vocational Training (MoEVT)
&#x2022; Strengthening of Monitoring, Evaluation and Assessment (MEA), under which was the:
- Development of MOEVT&#x2019;s website, and
- Financial Management Reform</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Zanzibars utbildningssektor f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av Zanzibars  strategiska plan f&#xf6;r undervisning, ZEDP, under tiden juni 2010 tom.   juni 2013. St&#xf6;det framf&#xf6;rallt inriktat p&#xe5; kapacitetsutveckling och    byggande av klassrum.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Zanzibar&apos;s education sector for implementation of the      Zanzibar Education Development Programme, ZEDP, from June 2010        through June 2013. The main parts of the support is aimed for         capacity building and classroom construction.</narrative>
  </description>
